{
  "sn12.44:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 12.44 ",
  "sn12.44:0.2": "5. Gahapativagga ",
  "sn12.44:0.3": "Lokasutta ",
  "sn12.44:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ viharati. ",
  "sn12.44:1.2": "“Lokassa, bhikkhave, samudayañca atthaṅgamañca desessāmi. ",
  "sn12.44:1.3": "Taṁ suṇātha, sādhukaṁ manasi karotha, bhāsissāmī”ti. ",
  "sn12.44:1.4": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "sn12.44:1.5": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn12.44:2.1": "“Katamo ca, bhikkhave, lokassa samudayo? ",
  "sn12.44:2.2": "Cakkhuñca paṭicca rūpe ca uppajjati cakkhuviññāṇaṁ. Tiṇṇaṁ saṅgati phasso. ",
  "sn12.44:2.3": "Phassapaccayā vedanā; ",
  "sn12.44:2.4": "vedanāpaccayā taṇhā; ",
  "sn12.44:2.5": "taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṁ; ",
  "sn12.44:2.6": "upādānapaccayā bhavo; ",
  "sn12.44:2.7": "bhavapaccayā jāti; ",
  "sn12.44:2.8": "jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇaṁ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā sambhavanti. ",
  "sn12.44:2.9": "Ayaṁ kho, bhikkhave, lokassa samudayo. ",
  "sn12.44:3.1": "Sotañca paṭicca sadde ca …pe… ",
  "sn12.44:3.2": "ghānañca paṭicca gandhe ca … ",
  "sn12.44:3.3": "jivhañca paṭicca rase ca … ",
  "sn12.44:3.4": "kāyañca paṭicca phoṭṭhabbe ca … ",
  "sn12.44:3.5": "manañca paṭicca dhamme ca uppajjati manoviññāṇaṁ. Tiṇṇaṁ saṅgati phasso. ",
  "sn12.44:3.6": "Phassapaccayā vedanā …pe… ",
  "sn12.44:3.7": "jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇaṁ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā sambhavanti. ",
  